    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: '2. On the cut stencil cut out 4 pieces of plastic, it will be 4 sides
    of the pyramid. You can use the transparent cover from the CD box. (one cover
    is enough for a small pyramid, four covers are needed for a large one). To do
    this with a utility knife, make incisions in the plastic at the edges of the
    stencil (BE CAREFUL WHEN WORKING WITH a box cutter!), then break off the extra
    parts of the side face of the pyramid.

'
